  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1815.05 Optional Information for Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1815.05 Optional Information for Applications.\n\n(a) Any applicant for an asbestos abatement entity license under this part that has business liability insurance or is bonded, or both, for work done under the license may submit proof of such insurance or bond, or both, with the application.\n\n(b) If proof of insurance or bond, or both, is submitted with the application and the application is approved, the department shall note that the licensee has represented that work done under the license is covered by insurance or a bond, or both, as applicable.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
